Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:05.70,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,3660,4780)\pos(635.906,311.273)}Episode 47
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:05.70,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,3660,4780)\pos(635.906,515.515)}Cutting the Beard \Nand Discarding the Robes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:11.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the 15th year of the Jian'an era, the end of 210 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:14.22,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,the Commander of Eastern Wu, Zhou Yu died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:18.24,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Cao Cao sought to take the opportunity to march south against Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:22.37,Thinking,,0,0,0,,but feared that Ma Teng would raid Xudu from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:27.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Thus he falsified an imperial edict, promoting Ma Teng to the "General who Conquers the South,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:34.39,Thinking,,0,0,0,,directing him to campaign against Sun Quan, \Nthus lure Ma Teng to the capital to eliminate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:39.09,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:42.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3700,4100)\pos(356.162,487.515)}Mă Téng\NStyled: Shòuchéng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.02,0:00:49.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,7700,8600)\pos(300.044,464.849)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Shoucheng, how do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:01:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That day you too received that "Decree Hidden in Cloth,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and today you conspire with traitorous officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If Heaven itself cannot destroy me, what could you possibly do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Release my father! Father shall slaughter you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Damned traitor Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.95,0:01:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Even if I die, my spirit will take your worthless life!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Dogs, all of you! \N-Take them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.82,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Heavens are watching, lightning will descend and burn upon you, you usurper bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.85,0:02:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Young sire, what is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I had a dream, I was face down in the snow,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:15.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3700,4100)\pos(981.473,471.515)}Páng Dé\NStyled: Lìngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.29,0:02:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,when several fierce tigers leapt towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible the elder general...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ma Dai?! \N-Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over! It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Uncle and Colonel Huang Kui plotted to kill Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.49,0:02:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but they were discovered by the traitor Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.59,0:02:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Uncle and second brother have both been killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:42.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,7700,8600)\pos(975.37,489.333)}Mǎ Dài
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.27,0:02:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I only got away by disguising myself as a merchant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master, young master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao bastard, you will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed a general with the might of a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You descend from a famed general of the Hàn, \Nfor what reason do you betray the Court?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:07.80,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Referring to Ma Yuan (馬援), a general who fought under Liu Xiu and helped establish the Eastern Han Dynasty. Famously battled the Trưng sisters of Vietnam
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard Cao, you usurp Imperial authority, commit unspeakable crimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,you killed my father and my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,you and I will not share the same Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I will take you alive, slice you with a thousand knives and peel you alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill the traitor and wage a battle here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.57,0:05:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand gold for the man who captures the traitor Cao alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The one with the red cloak is Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:10.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The one with the red cloak is Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:13.86,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Catch Cao Cao, catch the Cao Cao wearing the red cloak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The long-bearded one is Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:54.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The long-bearded one is Cao Cao! Catch Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch the Cao Cao with the long beard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Catch traitor Cao! The short-bearded one is Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:40.58,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,The short-bearded one is Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,After him! Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.03,0:09:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor Cao, your life is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-My life is ended! \N-Flee not, bastard Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:35.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3700,4100)\pos(981.473,471.515)}Cáo Hóng\NStyled: Zǐlián
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not harm my lord! Cao Hong is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, officer Cao Hong pays his respects!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No need for formalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Cao Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.11,0:10:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How are your wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I am alive, only thanks to your heroic rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone come here. Reward him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:10:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor. The Xiliang soldiers mostly use pikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Our weapons are relatively short, thus we tend to suffer in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.09,0:11:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In my opinion, we should use bows and crossbows to meet the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The choice to battle or not, lies with me. How could I let that young cur Ma Chao dictate to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.24,0:11:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Though he has a spear, he really thinks he can just stab me so casually?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.81,0:11:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,From tonight, no one is to meet them in battle. Those who disobey me are to be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Report! Chancellor, the administrator of Xiliang, {\i1}Han Sui,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,is leading an army to reinforce Ma Chao.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Heavens aiding us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:13.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the enemy is receiving reinforcements, why does milord laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we defeat the Qiang-soldiers, I shall explain to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:29.36,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Qiāng (羌) were the semi-nomadic peoples of northwest China. Ma Teng himself is half-Qiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gongming! \N{\i1}-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a good strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.92,0:12:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,As of now, almost the entirety of the Qiang-army is camped above Tong Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Leaving Hexi no defensive measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:48.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3700,4100)\pos(297.372,498.181)}Xú Huǎng\NStyled: Gōngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.69,0:12:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If we send a detachment to ferry to Pujin Ford in secret and cut off their path of retreat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor could then send troops to Hebei to strike them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:13:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao will be unable to deal with both front and rear, surrounding him on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, Gongming speaks my intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you to take four thousand elite troops with Zhu Ling to attack Hexi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,After that is successful, lie in ambush in the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait for me to cross the river, \Nthen we strike Ma Chao with a pincer attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}Cao Cao does not attack Tong Pass
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.86,0:13:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}and has his people prepare boats; he wants to cut off my retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I will lead an army along the river to guard from the north shore
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}so the Cao army is unable to cross the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Within twenty days, supplies will run out and the Cao army is certain to fall into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Then we attack along the river, \Nand we can surely capture Traitor Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.96,0:13:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}There is no need for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}As the Art of War says: {\i1}"Attack the troops halfway through crossing."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}You can set an ambush on the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.20,0:14:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}When the Cao army is halfway across, attack from the southern shore
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}and the Cao army will perish in the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}Uncle's words are most excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Your nephew will send people to scout out when the Cao army plans to cross the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Chancellor, emergency! \N-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.23,0:14:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The sand walls the troops constructed \Nhave been blown apart by a great wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been careless, I did not think the soil was so soft here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible to use hemp cloth and rope to make sandbags for the barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.79,0:14:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The project is too vast,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it may not be possible to gather so many sandbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,On this campaign, we have been harassed and troubled by Ma Chao many times
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,all to the lack of walls and towers as a buffer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:13.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and thus giving those long spears of the Qiang-soldiers every advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:19.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we cannot build up a defense soon, \Nwe may suffer defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What to do now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Heavens aid me indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight the wind is cold, water will freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.06,0:16:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Though the dirt may scatter, \Nwe can freeze it by pouring water on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.60,0:16:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Order the soldiers to move earth and water immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.54,0:16:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In one night, we can finish the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.67,0:16:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Truly, the Heavens aid me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.56,0:17:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The bastard Cao has lost every engagement thus far, he is faltering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In addition the Cao forces have no walls to rely on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our battle today must be decisive, our victory will be total.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:17.12,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3700,4100)\pos(513.826,471.515)}Hán Suì\NStyled: Wényuē
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Noble nephew, you are most correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, this is the person who saved that lowlife Cao the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.59,0:18:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This man is Xu Chu, Xu Zhongkang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.97,0:18:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He is fierce and mighty, they call him {\i1}"the Tiger Fool."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mengqi, be careful not to underestimate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I ride here alone, to invite Ma Chao to speak with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao, you mocked me for failing to construct my fort, but today the Heavens aided me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.39,0:18:54.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In just one night, a great wall has been created,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,so why don't you just surrender right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.27,0:19:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I heard your army has a "Tiger Fool."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.11,0:19:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Which one of you is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.91,0:19:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It is I, Xu Chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ma Chao is valiant beyond compare,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but I have the "Tiger Marquis" to face him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Truly a furious battle! I've been on horseback half my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and have yet to see a matchup so ferocious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:34.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ma Chao, our warhorses are both exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:36.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Shall we switch out mounts and then resume?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:35.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3700,4100)\pos(376.204,463.515)}Xǔ Chǔ\N Styled; Zhòngkāng
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, we'll replace our mounts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, please be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.57,0:23:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.40,0:24:20.64,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Cao Cao's attempt to ferry across Wei River failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.88,0:24:26.10,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Luckily, the "Tiger Fool" Xu Chu protected him, \Nand he fled to the south shore to establish a base.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.86,0:24:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ma Chao is no less a ferocious warrior than Lü Bu back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.98,0:24:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we are to break Ma Chao, we have to use cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:38.64,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.82,0:24:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor, General Xu Huang has crossed the river, and established a camp at Hexi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.84,0:24:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He awaits your orders to strike Ma Chao from both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.85,0:24:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Leave. \N{\i1}-Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.40,0:24:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}Wenhe...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.98,0:24:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Present.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.22,0:25:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I see you as akin to the builders of Han Dynasty, Zhang Liang and Chen Ping.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.38,0:25:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,666.667)}Why have you spoken so little recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.24,0:25:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Chancellor, victory is within our grasp. What else is there to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.78,0:25:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hear your counsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.46,0:25:23.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3700,4100)\pos(402.927,464.849)}Jiǎ Xù \NStyled: Wénhé
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.75,0:25:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ma Chao led the Qiang forces to take Chang'an and Tong Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.94,0:25:25.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He had intended to finish it all at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.39,0:25:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but he has been stymied at the Wei River by you, sire, and thus his morale must be declining.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.33,0:25:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now General Xu has cut off his retreat, \NMa Chao's army's spirits must be shaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.73,0:25:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition, Han Sui is brash in his methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.20,0:25:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If he sees that Ma Chao cannot claim victory soon, \Nhe will wish to seek a truce.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.34,0:25:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.11,0:25:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,why not take this opportunity to divide the two of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.57,0:25:55.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and achieve our triumph thusly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.86,0:26:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,666.667)}Great minds think alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.92,0:26:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}To win against one is arduous, to win against two is effortless.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.78,0:26:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Sir, your plan to sow dissent among two was an idea I had pondered upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.46,0:26:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,666.667)}First, I must write a letter to Han Sui first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.96,0:26:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mengqi, Xu Huang has already encamped at Hexi, our forces are threatened from both front and rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.90,0:26:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Cao Cao has sent his treaty, it would be better for us to cease fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.64,0:26:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,After this winter, when the weather warms, we can make further plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.61,0:27:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard Cao's viciousness is unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.88,0:27:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Though he promises to return the lands of Hexi to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.66,0:27:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,if we believed him so easily, he could cross us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.85,0:27:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be better to wait for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.14,0:27:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,At this time, Uncle and I will defend in rotation against the two sides of Cao Cao and Xu Huang,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.92,0:27:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,to guard against any deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.40,0:27:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We will wait until he retreats,\N then continue any discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.10,0:27:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.58,0:27:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Uncle, I am going to scout Xu Huang's camp today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.40,0:27:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So I will have to trouble Uncle to hold the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.82,0:27:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, you can be at ease, noble nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.19,0:27:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.72,0:28:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is guarding the fortress tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.10,0:28:22.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(769.605,186.667)}"Hán"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.23,0:28:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Success will be ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.34,0:28:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There! See, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.68,0:28:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Which one is Cao Cao? \N-The one in red.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.84,0:28:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,662.667)}Soldiers there, you wish to see sir Cao?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.84,0:28:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Indeed I am the Chancellor of our great Han Dynasty, yet I am still but a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.66,0:28:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}I don't have four eyes, nor two mouths,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.36,0:29:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}I'm just one bit smarter than most!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.32,0:29:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor invites General Han to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.70,0:29:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,General Han, I come in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.34,0:29:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We meet at last, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.92,0:29:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Your father and I were both nominated to the court in {\i1}xiaolian{\i0} to serve the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.08,0:29:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}He was like family to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.36,0:29:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}Later, we both stepped onto the course of offices,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.66,0:29:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}yet the passage of time is unkind to us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.80,0:30:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}I remember the Chancellor's {\i1}"Short Song Style,"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.86,0:30:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}those lines of {\i1}"dawn's dew" {\i0}and {\i1}"robe of blue,"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.68,0:30:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}had me recall my own life, \Nthose {\i1}"past days many, but futures few."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.04,0:30:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I am but five years further along in my life than you, general.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.74,0:30:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}To think once upon a time, you and I were both at the capital, young and full of vigor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.74,0:30:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Now we are past our prime, \Nwith only gray hairs to show.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.00,0:30:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Life is like a white steed crossing \Nthe ravine, gone before one's notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.72,0:30:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,648)}So what use is there to squabble?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.10,0:30:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The general speaks true!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.11,0:31:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us wish for a world at peace, \Nand for us to enjoy it in restful merriment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:15.20,Thinking,,0,0,0,,What do you think about this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.20,0:31:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Noble nephew, for what reason are you here at this late hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.88,0:31:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I heard that Uncle met with Cao Cao before the battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.67,0:31:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I wonder what you discussed?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.52,0:31:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Only about our olden days in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.35,0:31:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And nothing of military import?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.22,0:31:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mengde did not bring that up, so why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.38,0:32:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Wenhe, I reckon what happened before the castle gates today,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.79,0:32:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,will indeed arouse suspicion in Ma Chao.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.74,0:32:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In my opinion, this is not enough to turn them against each other yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.53,0:32:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan, that will cause men of Han and Ma to turn on each other in fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.37,0:32:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.57,0:33:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor Cao is waiting for your reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.07,0:33:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.79,0:33:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The envoy says that the Chancellor is waiting for your reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.99,0:33:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.59,0:33:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Honored Uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.46,0:33:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I heard Cao Cao sent a letter to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.27,0:34:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I would like to see what he wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.67,0:34:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The letter is right here, you can read it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.15,0:34:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are there so many lines wiped away?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.08,0:34:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The original letter was like this, I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.50,0:34:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Perhaps Cao Cao accidentally sent his draft here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.33,0:34:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How could someone accidentally send out their draft?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.50,0:34:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Uncle was afraid that I would learn the details, and edited this letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.74,0:34:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor Cao is a meticulous creature, how could he make such a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.88,0:34:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle and I are fighting the traitors together, so why would I be suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.28,0:34:51.96,Note (Potential style?),NTP,0,0,0,,Note: The expression refers to an unbreakable bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.28,0:34:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Your father and I cultivated a friendship of golden orchids.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.12,0:34:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why would you be suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.86,0:34:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just know there were Cao Cao's spies, spreading rumors in my camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.49,0:35:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,bringing up the matter of my father fighting with Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.29,0:35:06.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have already ordered them executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.07,0:35:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.20,0:35:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So even if I said a thousand words, I cannot prove my innocence!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.94,0:35:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this, tomorrow I will come before our troops and invite Cao Cao to speak with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.06,0:35:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can charge out of the formation, \Nand kill him with a single spear thrust.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.19,0:35:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If that can be done, then I can see Uncle's truthfulness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.32,0:36:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I invite Chancellor Cao to come out and speak with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.06,0:36:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We invite Chancellor Cao to come out and speak with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.36,0:36:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General Han, please ensure that there are no errors with Chancellor's letter from last night!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.34,0:36:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What-?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.78,0:36:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Noble nephew, please calm, \NI bear no ill will towards you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.36,0:36:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.86,0:36:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao is capricious, and relies on his \Nmartial prowess to domineer over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.94,0:36:55.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Even if we can beat Cao Cao, Ma Chao would not accept us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.61,0:36:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I suggest we surrender to Chancellor Cao now,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.42,0:37:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and we can keep our noble rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.72,0:37:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Teng and I did fight each other in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.08,0:37:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but afterwards we let bygones be bygones, and swore to be brothers in life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.68,0:37:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I bear to betray him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.63,0:37:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you swore an oath with Ma Teng, Ma Chao has neither kindness nor honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.53,0:37:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, there's no better alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.07,0:37:30.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Very well. I will send you to the Cao camp to discuss terms of surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.02,0:37:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,General, the soldiers in all divisions are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.29,0:37:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor Cao's army has assembled below the walls, they await our signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.14,0:37:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we will take Ma Chao alive, and force him to submit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.82,0:37:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes-!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.90,0:37:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitors! You conspire against me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.53,0:38:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.24,0:38:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.68,0:38:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao forces have entered the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.55,0:38:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please leave quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.26,0:38:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,General, please go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.86,0:38:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.39,0:39:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.83,0:39:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,General, leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.34,0:39:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare harm my lord!

